Module test.insurance.auto.

# 合成示例策略——数值取自公开权威来源（2026-08 检索），非真实保险公司费率表。
#   · 年龄因子：CarInsurance.com / Quadrant Information Services 2026-07 全险年保费
#     （100/300/100 限额、$500 免赔、2025 Honda Accord LX、清白记录）
#     以 60 岁 $2312（全表最低）为基准 100。
#     ★可直接核对的三档（单龄价 ÷ 2312）：40 岁 $2578→112(实现 109)、
#       70 岁 $2498→108(实现 108)、75 岁 $2742→119(实现 119)。
#     ★年轻两档**不是**单龄价换算，而是**档内取值**且经人为收敛：
#       16-19 档单龄价 $10387/$8614/$7498/$5718（档均 $8054→348），实现取 320；
#       20-24 档档均 $4050→175，实现取 155。
#       收敛理由：单龄极值（16 岁 449）会让样本保费脱离量级可读范围。
#       故这两档是**工程取值**，不可直接引用为费率。
#   · 车龄因子：The Zebra（每增 1 年降约 3.4%，8 年车龄比新车便宜约 25%）
#     ★实现的 125/115/100/84/75 是**分档近似**：新车→4-8 年档为 100/125 = 便宜 20%，
#       与来源的「8 年便宜 25%」差 5pp（分档必然损失连续曲线的精度）。
#       断言锁的是「越旧越便宜」的单调关系，不是具体折扣率。
#   · 事故加费 +46%：ValuePenguin +49% 与 QuoteFii +44% 的中值
#   · 违章加费 +23%：全国均值 +23%（Liberty Mutual ≈+25%；州际 NY +7% 至 NC +49%）
#   · 低信用 +91%：III（保险信息研究所）口径
#     ★加州/夏威夷/马萨诸塞/密歇根禁止用信用分定价——真实系统须按州禁用此因子
#   · 免赔额档位：CarInsurance.com / Quadrant 2026-04（$250/$500/$1000）
#   · 责任限额：III 推荐 100/300/100（= 每人伤害 $100k / 每次事故 $300k /
#     财产损失 $100k，**三个独立限额**）。
#     ★实现把三段**折叠成单一 `coverageLimit`**（premium 300000 / standard
#     100000 / basic 50000）——PolicyQuote 只有一个限额字段，样本不建模
#     per-person / per-accident / property 的区分。故这三个数**不是**
#     100/300/100 中的任何一段，只是借其量级做的分档，不可对号入座。

Define Driver has driverId, age, yearsLicensed, accidentCount, violationCount, creditScore.

Define Vehicle has vin, year, make, model, value, safetyRating.

Define PolicyQuote has approved, reason, monthlyPremium, deductible, coverageLimit.

Rule calculateAgeFactor given age, produce:
  If age less than 20
    Return 320.
  If age less than 25
    Return 155.
  If age less than 30
    Return 118.
  If age less than 50
    Return 109.
  If age less than 65
    Return 100.
  If age less than 75
    Return 108.
  Return 119.
Rule calculateVehicleFactor given vehicle, produce:
  Let vehicleAge be 2026 minus vehicle.year.
  If vehicleAge at most 0
    Return 125.
  If vehicleAge at most 3
    Return 115.
  If vehicleAge at most 8
    Return 100.
  If vehicleAge at most 15
    Return 84.
  Return 75.
Rule calculateRiskMultiplier given driver, vehicle, produce:
  Let base be 100.
  If driver.accidentCount at least 1
    Let base be base plus (driver.accidentCount times 46).
  If driver.violationCount at least 1
    Let base be base plus (driver.violationCount times 23).
  If driver.creditScore less than 580
    Let base be base plus 91.
  If vehicle.safetyRating at most 2
    Let base be base plus 10.
  Return base.
Rule calculateBasePremium given driver, vehicle, produce:
  Let ageFactor be calculateAgeFactor(driver.age).
  Let vehicleFactor be calculateVehicleFactor(vehicle).
  Return ((2312 times ageFactor) times vehicleFactor) divided by 10000.
Rule determineDeductible given coverageType, creditScore, produce:
  If coverageType equals to "premium"
    If creditScore at least 670
      Return 250.
    Return 500.
  If coverageType equals to "standard"
    If creditScore at least 670
      Return 500.
    Return 1000.
  Return 1000.
Rule determineCoverageLimit given coverageType, vehicleValue, produce:
  If coverageType equals to "premium"
    Return 300000.
  If coverageType equals to "standard"
    Return 100000.
  Return 50000.
Rule generateAutoQuote given driver, vehicle, coverageType, produce:
  If driver.age less than 18
    Return PolicyQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Driver under minimum age", monthlyPremium set to 0, deductible set to 0, coverageLimit set to 0.
  If driver.accidentCount at least 4
    Return PolicyQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Accident history exceeds underwriting threshold", monthlyPremium set to 0, deductible set to 0, coverageLimit set to 0.
  If driver.violationCount at least 5
    Return PolicyQuote with approved set to false, reason set to "Violation history exceeds underwriting threshold", monthlyPremium set to 0, deductible set to 0, coverageLimit set to 0.
  Let basePremium be calculateBasePremium(driver, vehicle).
  Let multiplier be calculateRiskMultiplier(driver, vehicle).
  Let annual be (basePremium times multiplier) divided by 100.
  Let monthly be (annual times 100) integer divided by 1200.
  Let deductible be determineDeductible(coverageType, driver.creditScore).
  Let limit be determineCoverageLimit(coverageType, vehicle.value).
  Return PolicyQuote with approved set to true, reason set to "Approved", monthlyPremium set to monthly, deductible set to deductible, coverageLimit set to limit.
Rule testDriverUnder18, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D1", age set to 17, yearsLicensed set to 1, accidentCount set to 0, violationCount set to 0, creditScore set to 700.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V1", year set to 2020, make set to "Honda", model set to "Accord", value set to 20000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "standard").
  Return quote.reason.
Rule testTooManyAccidents, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D2", age set to 30, yearsLicensed set to 12, accidentCount set to 4, violationCount set to 0, creditScore set to 700.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V2", year set to 2020, make set to "Honda", model set to "Accord", value set to 20000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "standard").
  Return quote.reason.
Rule testTooManyViolations, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D3", age set to 30, yearsLicensed set to 12, accidentCount set to 0, violationCount set to 5, creditScore set to 700.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V3", year set to 2020, make set to "Honda", model set to "Accord", value set to 20000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "standard").
  Return quote.reason.
Rule testYoungDriverPremiumCoverage, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D4", age set to 19, yearsLicensed set to 2, accidentCount set to 0, violationCount set to 0, creditScore set to 700.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V4", year set to 2024, make set to "Honda", model set to "Civic", value set to 25000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "premium").
  Return quote.monthlyPremium.
Rule testMiddleAgedDriverStandardCoverage, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D5", age set to 40, yearsLicensed set to 22, accidentCount set to 0, violationCount set to 0, creditScore set to 720.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V5", year set to 2020, make set to "Honda", model set to "Accord", value set to 20000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "standard").
  Return quote.monthlyPremium.
Rule testSeniorDriverBasicCoverage, produce:
  Let driver be Driver with driverId set to "D6", age set to 70, yearsLicensed set to 50, accidentCount set to 0, violationCount set to 0, creditScore set to 750.
  Let vehicle be Vehicle with vin set to "V6", year set to 2018, make set to "Toyota", model set to "Camry", value set to 15000, safetyRating set to 5.
  Let quote be generateAutoQuote(driver, vehicle, "basic").
